abstract: "Twenty papers and four applied notes (September 2026), assembled into a monograph of 26 chapters, on the sandpile groups of Hecke-Laplacians over quotients of Bruhat-Tits trees and A~2 / A~d buildings, their towers, and the operator algebras that carry them; with the verification scripts, data tables and figures that reproduce every numerical claim. The biological strand (Bio 1-11) is Volume II, Algebraic Genomics, published separately."
